WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.740
Rift, then accumulate a shelf

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:50.030
Add arcs and shuffle the margin

00:00:50.030 --> 00:01:17.360
A Mesozoic convergent margin

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:39.490
Flatten the slab, move deformation inland

00:01:39.490 --> 00:02:07.950
Extend and transform
